{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"74c95c54-dcd1-433b-bc59-6446b8a1c3ef","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The integration issues have been resolved, and the causes and fixes are documented in [ANSWER.md](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/ANSWER.md).\n\n### Summary of Root Causes \u0026 Fixes\n\n1. **Connect Button 401 Unauthorized**:\n   * **Cause**: In [static/app.js](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/static/app.js), the \"Connect Intervals.icu\" button was an `\u003ca href=\"/api/intervals/auth/init\"\u003e` link performing full-page browser document navigation. Standard document navigation drops the `Authorization: Bearer` header stored in `localStorage`, causing `require_user()` in [server.py](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/server.py) to reject the request with `401 Unauthorized`.\n   * **Fix**: Changed `/api/intervals/auth/init` to a `POST` endpoint returning `{\"authorize_url\": ...}`, and updated the SPA to trigger an authenticated `api(\"/api/intervals/auth/init\", { method: \"POST\" })` fetch call carrying the bearer token, then redirect via `window.location.assign(data.authorize_url)`.\n\n2. **Authorization 400 `{\"error\":\"invalid_request\"}` (\"Duplicate scope\")**:\n   * **Cause**: In [config.py](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/config.py), scopes included both `:READ` and `:WRITE` for the same domain (`ACTIVITY:READ,ACTIVITY:WRITE` and `CALENDAR:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`). Intervals.icu automatically implies read permissions with write scopes and rejects requests specifying the same area twice.\n   * **Fix**: Deduplicated the scopes in [config.py](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/config.py) to `ACTIVITY:WRITE,WELLNESS:READ,CALENDAR:WRITE`.\n\n3. **Status Becoming \"expired, reconnect\" After 1 Hour**:\n   * **Cause**: Intervals.icu tokens do not expire and do not issue refresh tokens. [server.py](file:///private/tmp/h-xjH0Oy/server.py) fell back to a 3600-second TTL and ran a background token refresh loop. Because no `refresh_token` existed, the loop marked the connection as `\"expired, reconnect\"` after an hour.\n   * **Fix**: Removed the background refresher and artificial token TTL. Tokens remain connected indefinitely until revoked, and token invalidation is handled lazily on `401` responses from the Intervals.icu API.\n","duration_seconds":328.839257,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":245290,"output_tokens":9601,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":2652045,"total_tokens":254891}}}
